---
layout: base.njk
title: Leading
description: The bigger work Ran Craycraft has led, from launching ventures at AOL to leading thoughtbot’s Americas business and Ruby Central.
permalink: /leading/
section: leading
---
<header class="page-head">
  <h1 class="page-title serif">Leading</h1>
  <div class="grid">
    <p class="span-main lede serif">The longer stories behind the work. Where things stood when I arrived, the calls that mattered, and what I’d tell someone facing the same thing.</p>
  </div>
</header>

{%- set stories = collections.posts | stories | chronological %}
{%- set filter_label = "Most recent first" %}{% set filter_options = site.leading_groups %}
{% include "filter.njk" %}
<div class="tiles tiles-2">
  {%- for p in stories %}
  <a href="{{ p.url }}" class="card"{% if p.data.led %} data-tags="{{ p.data.led }}"{% endif %}>
    <span class="media">{% set ratio = "3 / 2" %}{% include "story-cover.njk" %}</span>
    <span class="card-title card-title-lg serif">{{ p.data.title }}</span>
    <span class="card-desc">{{ p.data.description }}</span>
    {%- set led = p.data.led | ledLabel %}
    {%- set org = p.data.case_study.organization if p.data.case_study else "" %}
    {%- if led or org %}<span class="card-meta">{{ led }}{% if led and org %} · {% endif %}{{ org }}</span>{% endif %}
  </a>
  {%- endfor %}
</div>
